.TH tutac 1 0.29.0 tclutils "Tcl Utility Command"
.SH NAME
tutac \- thin CLI wrapper for tclutils::tutac
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
tutac ?file?
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The tutac command is a thin wrapper around the Tcl package tclutils::tutac. It is intended for interactive and scripting use when tclutils is installed from source. The primary API remains the Tcl library; see tutac(n) for procedures, options, and semantics.
.PP
Run the script with tclsh:
.PP
.nf
tclsh bin/tutac.tcl ...
.fi
